Phase 4 follow-up - trigger_test_prayer mirrors the scheduler's prayer-fired event.

The Settings "test prayer" triggers now also emit "prayer-fired" (always,
whenever the command succeeds — i.e. at least one of the notification/adhan
toggles is enabled, matching the existing Err path semantics). This mirrors
fire_prayer, which emits the event unconditionally, and makes the prayer-time
prompt verifiable end-to-end without waiting for a real prayer time:
Settings -> test prayer -> prompt appears -> tap "Prayed" -> entry appears
in the Log.

